-           column  Case
-           column  Code
-           column  Message
-           column  Note
-           row  `Truncated(offset)`  1  _the message ends at offset `offset`, inside a field_  a malformed message
-           row  `BadPointer(offset)`  2  _the name pointer at offset `offset` points forward_  a malformed message
-           row  `BadLabel(offset, kind)`  3  _the label at offset `offset` has unsupported type `kind`_  a malformed message
-           row  `LongLabel(label)`  4  _the label `label` is longer than 63 octets_  a bad name
-           row  `LongName(name)`  5  _the name `name` is longer than 255 octets_  a bad name
-           row  `EmptyLabel(text)`  6  _the name `text` contains an empty label_  a bad name
-           row  `BadEscape(text)`  7  _the name `text` contains a malformed escape sequence_  a bad name
-           row  `BadRdata(rtype, offset)`  8  _the `rtype` record data at offset `offset` is malformed_  a malformed message
-           row  `LongString(length)`  9  _a character-string of `length` octets exceeds 255_  a TXT string
-           row  `Trailing(offset)`  10  _the message has trailing bytes from offset `offset`_  a malformed message
-           row  `Unresolved(name)`  11  _the name `name` could not be resolved_  from `Dns.resolve`
-           row  `Timeout`  12  _no response arrived before the timeout_  raised by a transport such as `coaxial.dns`
